      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-28T11:20:41Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, verified NovaBox source, commit-pinned reproduction, creation trace, historical runtime, and balances. A constructor helper first deposits NOVA, then bypasses the fallback's extcodesize check to deposit 427.5 ETH; addToList activates it without initialising four dividend checkpoints, and withdrawEth immediately pays stale dividends. The trace returns 484.442794338375078272 ETH to the helper and pays 8.07975 ETH in owner fees, reducing NovaBox from 65.112960940830125829 ETH to 0.090416602455047557 ETH. All failure-bearing calls execute directly at 0xbc4191167d4b0251cab5201a527daa8a7d3846b0. Its creator deployed a 6,336-byte runtime at block 6495455; its hash is 0xe0167c74ecb266b7eb8584596b24b397e4d43138014269e4dd0823ee8b344fc3 both at deployment and immediately before exploit block 25281768, with no DELEGATECALL, SELFDESTRUCT, or CREATE2 opcode."
